# Inspira AWS Serverless 部署方案

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 你的项目目前还缺三块：**用户认证**、**文件持久化存储（数据库）**、**前后端连接调 LLM**。下面的方案会把这三块一并解决，和 AWS 部署整合在一起。

---

## 📊 当前状态 vs 目标状态

| 功能 | 当前状态 | 部署后目标 | 用到的 AWS 服务 |
|------|---------|-----------|----------------|
| 前端 | Vite + React 本地 dev | S3 + CloudFront 全球 CDN | S3, CloudFront |
| 后端 API | FastAPI 本地跑 | Lambda + API Gateway (真 serverless) | Lambda, API Gateway |
| 用户登录 | ❌ 没有 | Cognito 托管认证 | Cognito |
| 文件存储 | ❌ 临时 temp 文件 | S3 持久存储 + DynamoDB 元数据 | S3, DynamoDB |
| 向量数据库 | ChromaDB 本地文件 | 仍用 ChromaDB on EFS or 换 OpenSearch Serverless | EFS / OpenSearch |
| LLM 调用 | 本地 Ollama | OpenAI API / Bedrock | Secrets Manager |
| 域名 HTTPS | ❌ | Route53 + ACM | Route53, ACM |

---

## 🏗️ 推荐架构（纯 Serverless）

你 DEV_README 里写的是 ECS Fargate 方案，但既然你说要 serverless，我推荐一个**更省钱、更简单**的纯 serverless 方案：

```
用户浏览器
    │
    ▼
CloudFront (CDN)
    │
    ├── 静态资源 → S3 (前端 React build)
    │
    └── /api/* → API Gateway (HTTP API)
                    │
                    ▼
              Lambda (FastAPI via Mangum)
                    │
            ┌───────┼───────┬──────────┐
            ▼       ▼       ▼          ▼
         Cognito  S3      DynamoDB   OpenAI/Bedrock
        (用户认证) (文件)  (元数据)    (LLM API)
```

> [!TIP]
> **为什么不用 ECS Fargate？** Lambda 在你这个阶段更合适——自动扩缩、不用管容器、按请求计费。FastAPI 通过 `Mangum` 适配器可以直接跑在 Lambda 上，代码改动极小。等后面流量大了或者需要长连接 SSE streaming 再考虑 Fargate。

> [!WARNING]
> Lambda 有 **29 秒超时限制**（API Gateway 触发时），LangGraph 推理如果链很长可能超时。解决方案在下面 Phase 4 里讲。

---

## 🚀 分阶段实施

### Phase 1: 前端部署到 S3 + CloudFront（最快见效）

**耗时：~1 小时**

#### 1.1 Build 前端

```bash
cd frontend
npm run build
# 产出在 frontend/dist/
```

#### 1.2 创建 S3 Bucket

```bash
# 创建桶
aws s3 mb s3://inspira-frontend-<your-unique-id> --region ap-southeast-1

# 上传 build 产物
aws s3 sync dist/ s3://inspira-frontend-<your-unique-id> --delete

# 配置静态网站托管
aws s3 website s3://inspira-frontend-<your-unique-id> \
  --index-document index.html \
  --error-document index.html
```

#### 1.3 创建 CloudFront 分发

```bash
aws cloudfront create-distribution \
  --origin-domain-name inspira-frontend-<your-unique-id>.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com \
  --default-root-object index.html
```

或者直接在 AWS Console 里点：
1. CloudFront → Create Distribution
2. Origin domain: 选你的 S3 bucket
3. **OAC (Origin Access Control)** → Create new → 选 S3
4. Default root object: [index.html](file:///f:/CS5224/Inspira/frontend/index.html)
5. **Custom error response**: 403/404 都 redirect 到 [/index.html](file:///f:/CS5224/Inspira/frontend/index.html)（SPA 路由需要）

> [!NOTE]
> CloudFront 会给你一个 `xxx.cloudfront.net` 域名，先用这个测试。后面再绑自定义域名。

---

### Phase 2: 用户认证 — Amazon Cognito

**耗时：~2-3 小时**

#### 2.1 创建 Cognito User Pool

```bash
aws cognito-idp create-user-pool \
  --pool-name InspiraUserPool \
  --auto-verified-attributes email \
  --username-attributes email \
  --policies '{"PasswordPolicy":{"MinimumLength":8,"RequireUppercase":true,"RequireLowercase":true,"RequireNumbers":true,"RequireSymbols":false}}'
```

#### 2.2 创建 App Client

```bash
aws cognito-idp create-user-pool-client \
  --user-pool-id <YOUR_POOL_ID> \
  --client-name InspiraWebApp \
  --explicit-auth-flows ALLOW_USER_SRP_AUTH ALLOW_REFRESH_TOKEN_AUTH \
  --supported-identity-providers COGNITO \
  --callback-urls '["https://your-cloudfront-domain.com/callback"]' \
  --logout-urls '["https://your-cloudfront-domain.com"]'
```

#### 2.3 前端集成 Cognito

安装 AWS Amplify（只用它的 Auth 模块，不用全家桶）：

```bash
cd frontend
npm install aws-amplify @aws-amplify/ui-react
```

创建 `src/config/aws-config.ts`：

```typescript
export const awsConfig = {
  Auth: {
    Cognito: {
      userPoolId: import.meta.env.VITE_COGNITO_USER_POOL_ID,
      userPoolClientId: import.meta.env.VITE_COGNITO_CLIENT_ID,
      loginWith: {
        email: true,
      },
    },
  },
};
```

在 [main.tsx](file:///f:/CS5224/Inspira/frontend/src/main.tsx) 初始化：

```typescript
import { Amplify } from "aws-amplify";
import { awsConfig } from "./config/aws-config";

Amplify.configure(awsConfig);
```

创建登录页面 `src/components/LoginPage.tsx`：

```tsx
import { Authenticator } from "@aws-amplify/ui-react";
import "@aws-amplify/ui-react/styles.css";

export function LoginPage({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {
  return (
    <Authenticator>
      {({ signOut, user }) => (
        <div>
          <header>
            <span>Welcome, {user?.signInDetails?.loginId}</span>
            <button onClick={signOut}>Sign Out</button>
          </header>
          {children}
        </div>
      )}
    </Authenticator>
  );
}
```

在 [App.tsx](file:///f:/CS5224/Inspira/frontend/src/App.tsx) 里包一下：

```tsx
import { LoginPage } from "./components/LoginPage";

function App() {
  return (
    <LoginPage>
      {/* 你现有的页面内容 */}
    </LoginPage>
  );
}
```

> [!TIP]
> `<Authenticator>` 组件自带注册/登录/忘记密码/邮箱验证全套 UI，你不需要自己写。样式可以通过 CSS variables 自定义。

#### 2.4 API 请求带 Token

```typescript
import { fetchAuthSession } from "aws-amplify/auth";

async function callApi(endpoint: string, body: any) {
  const session = await fetchAuthSession();
  const token = session.tokens?.idToken?.toString();

  return fetch(`${import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL}${endpoint}`, {
    method: "POST",
    headers: {
      "Content-Type": "application/json",
      Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`,
    },
    body: JSON.stringify(body),
  });
}
```

---

### Phase 3: 后端部署到 Lambda + API Gateway

**耗时：~3-4 小时**

#### 3.1 安装 Mangum（Lambda 适配器）

```bash
pip install mangum
```

#### 3.2 修改 [main.py](file:///f:/CS5224/Inspira/backend/main.py)

```python
from fastapi import FastAPI, UploadFile, File, HTTPException, Depends
from fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware
from mangum import Mangum
import boto3
import os

app = FastAPI(title="Inspira Backend API")

# CORS - 允许 CloudFront 域名
origins = [
    os.getenv("FRONTEND_URL", "http://localhost:5173"),
]

app.add_middleware(
    CORSMiddleware,
    allow_origins=origins,
    allow_credentials=True,
    allow_methods=["*"],
    allow_headers=["*"],
)

# S3 client for file storage
s3 = boto3.client("s3")
UPLOAD_BUCKET = os.getenv("UPLOAD_BUCKET", "inspira-user-uploads")

# DynamoDB for metadata
dynamodb = boto3.resource("dynamodb")
files_table = dynamodb.Table(os.getenv("FILES_TABLE", "inspira-files"))


@app.post("/api/upload")
async def upload_file(file: UploadFile = File(...)):
    """上传文件到 S3 + 元数据存 DynamoDB"""
    # TODO: 从 Cognito token 拿 user_id
    user_id = "demo-user"

    # 上传到 S3
    s3_key = f"uploads/{user_id}/{file.filename}"
    s3.upload_fileobj(file.file, UPLOAD_BUCKET, s3_key)

    # 元数据存 DynamoDB
    files_table.put_item(Item={
        "user_id": user_id,
        "filename": file.filename,
        "s3_key": s3_key,
        "content_type": file.content_type,
    })

    return {"message": "Uploaded", "s3_key": s3_key}


@app.post("/api/chat")
async def chat_endpoint(request: ChatRequest):
    """调 LLM 的 endpoint"""
    # OpenAI API key 从 Secrets Manager 或环境变量拿
    # ...你现有的 reasoning_app.invoke(inputs) 逻辑
    pass


# Lambda handler
handler = Mangum(app, lifespan="off")
```

#### 3.3 用 SAM 或 CDK 部署

推荐用 **AWS SAM**（比手动 zip 简单）：

创建 `backend/template.yaml`：

```yaml
AWSTemplateFormatVersion: "2010-09-09"
Transform: AWS::Serverless-2016-10-31
Description: Inspira Backend API

Globals:
  Function:
    Timeout: 30
    MemorySize: 512
    Runtime: python3.11
    Architectures:
      - x86_64
    Environment:
      Variables:
        UPLOAD_BUCKET: !Ref UploadBucket
        FILES_TABLE: !Ref FilesTable
        OPENAI_API_KEY: "{{resolve:secretsmanager:inspira/openai:SecretString:api_key}}"
        FRONTEND_URL: !Sub "https://${CloudFrontDomain}"

Resources:
  # ========== API ==========
  HttpApi:
    Type: AWS::Serverless::HttpApi
    Properties:
      StageName: prod
      CorsConfiguration:
        AllowOrigins:
          - "*"
        AllowMethods:
          - GET
          - POST
          - PUT
          - DELETE
          - OPTIONS
        AllowHeaders:
          - "*"

  # ========== Lambda ==========
  BackendFunction:
    Type: AWS::Serverless::Function
    Properties:
      Handler: main.handler
      CodeUri: .
      Events:
        ApiEvent:
          Type: HttpApi
          Properties:
            ApiId: !Ref HttpApi
            Path: /api/{proxy+}
            Method: ANY
      Policies:
        - S3CrudPolicy:
            BucketName: !Ref UploadBucket
        - DynamoDBCrudPolicy:
            TableName: !Ref FilesTable
        - AWSSecretsManagerGetSecretValuePolicy:
            SecretArn: !Sub "arn:aws:secretsmanager:${AWS::Region}:${AWS::AccountId}:secret:inspira/openai-*"

  # ========== Storage ==========
  UploadBucket:
    Type: AWS::S3::Bucket
    Properties:
      BucketName: !Sub "inspira-uploads-${AWS::AccountId}"

  FilesTable:
    Type: AWS::DynamoDB::Table
    Properties:
      TableName: inspira-files
      BillingMode: PAY_PER_REQUEST
      AttributeDefinitions:
        - AttributeName: user_id
          AttributeType: S
        - AttributeName: filename
          AttributeType: S
      KeySchema:
        - AttributeName: user_id
          KeyType: HASH
        - AttributeName: filename
          KeyType: RANGE

  # ========== Cognito ==========
  UserPool:
    Type: AWS::Cognito::UserPool
    Properties:
      UserPoolName: InspiraUserPool
      AutoVerifiedAttributes:
        - email
      UsernameAttributes:
        - email

  UserPoolClient:
    Type: AWS::Cognito::UserPoolClient
    Properties:
      UserPoolId: !Ref UserPool
      ClientName: InspiraWebClient
      ExplicitAuthFlows:
        - ALLOW_USER_SRP_AUTH
        - ALLOW_REFRESH_TOKEN_AUTH

Outputs:
  ApiUrl:
    Value: !Sub "https://${HttpApi}.execute-api.${AWS::Region}.amazonaws.com/prod"
  UserPoolId:
    Value: !Ref UserPool
  UserPoolClientId:
    Value: !Ref UserPoolClient
```

#### 3.4 部署命令

```bash
cd backend

# 首次初始化
sam init  # 如果还没有配置

# Build（会自动安装 requirements.txt 的依赖到 Lambda 包）
sam build

# 部署
sam deploy --guided
# 按提示填：
#   Stack name: inspira-backend
#   Region: ap-southeast-1
#   Confirm changeset: Y
```

> [!WARNING]
> **Lambda 部署包大小限制**：直接压缩包上限 50MB，层(Layer) 250MB 解压后。你的 [requirements.txt](file:///f:/CS5224/Inspira/backend/requirements.txt) 里有 `torch` 和 `sentence-transformers`，这些**巨大**，不适合塞进 Lambda。解决方案见下面。

#### 3.5 处理大依赖问题

`torch` + `sentence-transformers` 太大（>1GB），不可能直接放 Lambda。有三种方案：

| 方案 | 说明 | 推荐度 |
|------|------|--------|
| **A) 全用 API** | Embedding 用 OpenAI `text-embedding-3-small`，不用本地模型 | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ |
| **B) Lambda Container Image** | 用 Docker image 部署 Lambda（上限 10GB） | ⭐⭐⭐ |
| **C) 混合架构** | Lambda 处理轻量请求，Embedding 用 SageMaker Endpoint | ⭐⭐ |

**推荐方案 A**：把 `jina-clip-v1` 本地推理换成 API 调用：

```python
# backend/rag_engine/embedder.py - 改造后
import openai
import os

client = openai.OpenAI(api_key=os.getenv("OPENAI_API_KEY"))

def embed_text(text: str) -> list[float]:
    """用 OpenAI API 做文本 embedding"""
    response = client.embeddings.create(
        model="text-embedding-3-small",
        input=text
    )
    return response.data[0].embedding

def embed_image(image_path: str) -> list[float]:
    """用 Gemini Vision / GPT-4o 生成图片描述后再 embed"""
    # 1. 先用 vision 模型描述图片
    description = describe_image(image_path)
    # 2. 再 embed 描述文字
    return embed_text(description)
```

然后从 [requirements.txt](file:///f:/CS5224/Inspira/backend/requirements.txt) 移除：
```diff
- torch
- sentence-transformers
- einops
+ openai
+ boto3
```

---

### Phase 4: 文件上传 + 数据库存储

**耗时：~2 小时**

#### 4.1 前端上传组件调后端

```typescript
// src/hooks/useUpload.ts
import { fetchAuthSession } from "aws-amplify/auth";

export async function uploadFile(file: File) {
  const session = await fetchAuthSession();
  const token = session.tokens?.idToken?.toString();

  const formData = new FormData();
  formData.append("file", file);

  const res = await fetch(`${import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL}/api/upload`, {
    method: "POST",
    headers: {
      Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`,
    },
    body: formData,
  });

  return res.json();
}
```

#### 4.2 DynamoDB 表设计

```
inspira-files 表:
├── PK: user_id (String)        # Cognito sub
├── SK: filename (String)       # 文件名
├── s3_key (String)             # S3 路径
├── content_type (String)       # MIME type
├── extracted_text (String)     # 提取的文本
├── embedded (Boolean)          # 是否已入向量库
├── created_at (String)         # ISO timestamp
└── file_size (Number)          # 字节数

inspira-sessions 表 (可选, 存对话历史):
├── PK: user_id (String)
├── SK: session_id#timestamp
├── question (String)
├── answer (String)
└── reasoning_trace (List)
```

---

### Phase 5: LLM 连接

#### 5.1 存 API Key 到 Secrets Manager

```bash
aws secretsmanager create-secret \
  --name inspira/openai \
  --secret-string '{"api_key":"sk-your-key-here"}'
```

#### 5.2 后端读取

```python
import boto3
import json

def get_secret(secret_name: str) -> dict:
    client = boto3.client("secretsmanager")
    response = client.get_secret_value(SecretId=secret_name)
    return json.loads(response["SecretString"])

# 在 model_client.py 里
secrets = get_secret("inspira/openai")
openai_client = openai.OpenAI(api_key=secrets["api_key"])
```

#### 5.3 Lambda 超时问题 — SSE Streaming 的替代方案

Lambda + API Gateway 不支持 SSE streaming。两个选项：

| 方案 | 如何实现 | 复杂度 |
|------|---------|--------|
| **WebSocket via API Gateway** | 建 WebSocket API，Lambda 推送中间步骤 | 中等 |
| **异步轮询** | POST `/api/chat` 返回 `task_id`，前端轮询 `GET /api/chat/{task_id}/status` | 简单 |

**推荐异步轮询**（简单够用）：

```python
import uuid
from datetime import datetime

# DynamoDB tasks table
tasks_table = dynamodb.Table("inspira-tasks")

@app.post("/api/chat")
async def start_chat(request: ChatRequest):
    task_id = str(uuid.uuid4())
    # 把任务丢到 SQS 或直接异步处理
    tasks_table.put_item(Item={
        "task_id": task_id,
        "status": "processing",
        "created_at": datetime.utcnow().isoformat(),
        "question": request.question,
    })
    # 触发异步 Lambda 执行推理
    # ...
    return {"task_id": task_id}

@app.get("/api/chat/{task_id}")
async def get_chat_result(task_id: str):
    item = tasks_table.get_item(Key={"task_id": task_id})["Item"]
    return item  # { status, answer, reasoning_trace, ... }
```

